ok-pyside-minimal is an unofficial redistribution of PySide6-Essentials.

PySide6 and Qt are developed by The Qt Company Ltd. and other contributors.
Original copyright and license notices in retained upstream files remain intact.
Upstream metadata declares LGPL-3.0-only OR GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only;
individual Qt components and third-party libraries have their own notices.
The MIT license in this repository applies only to this project's original tooling.

Modifications: files for excluded Qt modules, tools and plugins are removed;
PySide6/__init__.py, _config.py, PySide6_Essentials.json and distribution
metadata are adjusted to describe the subset. Retained native binaries are
not patched or recompiled. The original wheel's source and build information
apply to them.

Corresponding upstream source and build instructions:
https://code.qt.io/cgit/pyside/pyside-setup.git/
https://code.qt.io/cgit/qt/qt5.git/
https://doc.qt.io/qtforpython-6/building_from_source/index.html
https://download.qt.io/official_releases/QtForPython/pyside6/
https://download.qt.io/official_releases/qt/

The exact version and source release directories are recorded in each wheel's
dist-info/upstream.json. For 6.12.0, the PySide source archive is:
https://download.qt.io/official_releases/QtForPython/pyside6/PySide6-6.12.0-src/pyside-setup-everywhere-src-6.12.0.tar.xz

The three license text copies in licenses/ were obtained from:
https://github.com/pyside/pyside-setup/tree/v6.12.0/LICENSES
